{
  "id": "M010",
  "title": "Have You Finished Packing Your Luggage?",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2022-01-14",
  "synopsis": "Lucy asks Lili if she has finished packing her luggage.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/90010/976d6c31ed72b38222753144c0642e0d5b0fb5b6.mp3?1637914709",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s Life After Graduation",
    "chapter": 9,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "你收拾好行李了吗？\n\n露西：丽丽，你工作做完了吗？\n丽丽：做完了，怎么了？\n露西：你收拾好行李了吗？\n丽丽：我昨天收拾好了。你呢？\n露西：我还没！我想带的东西太多了。你可以来帮我吗？\n丽丽：可以啊！我现在去你家帮你收拾吧。\n露西：太谢谢你啦！我在家里等你。你到了我家以后，给我发一个短信哦！\n丽丽：好，一会儿见。",
    "traditional": "你收拾好行李了嗎？\n\n露西：麗麗，你工作做完了嗎？\n麗麗：做完了，怎麼了？\n露西：你收拾好行李了嗎？\n麗麗：我昨天收拾好了。你呢？\n露西：我還沒！我想帶的東西太多了。你可以來幫我嗎？\n麗麗：可以啊！我現在去你家幫你收拾吧。\n露西：太謝謝你啦！我在家裡等你。你到了我家以後，給我發一個短信哦！\n麗麗：好，一會兒見。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Have You Finished Packing Your Luggage?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "露西：丽丽，你工作做完了吗？",
      "traditional": "露西：麗麗，你工作做完了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lù xī lì lì nǐ gōng zuò zuò wán le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Lili, have you finished your work?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：做完了，怎么了？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：做完了，怎麼了？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zuò wán le zěn me le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Yes I have, what’s up?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "露西：你收拾好行李了吗？",
      "traditional": "露西：你收拾好行李了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lù xī nǐ shōu shi hǎo xíng li le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Have you finished packing your luggage?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：我昨天收拾好了。你呢？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：我昨天收拾好了。你呢？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì wǒ zuó tiān shōu shi hǎo le nǐ ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: I finished packing yesterday. What about you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "露西：我还没！我想带的东西太多了。你可以来帮我吗？",
      "traditional": "露西：我還沒！我想帶的東西太多了。你可以來幫我嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lù xī wǒ hái méi wǒ xiǎng dài de dōng xi tài duō le nǐ kě yǐ lái bāng wǒ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: I haven’t yet! There are too many things that I want to bring. Can you come and help me?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽：可以啊！我现在去你家帮你收拾吧。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：可以啊！我現在去你家幫你收拾吧。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì kě yǐ a wǒ xiàn zài qù nǐ jiā bāng nǐ shōu shi ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Sure! I will go to your house to help you pack now."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "露西：太谢谢你啦！我在家里等你。你到了我家以后，给我发一个短信哦！",
      "traditional": "露西：太謝謝你啦！我在家裡等你。你到了我家以後，給我發一個短信哦！",
      "pinyin": "lù xī tài xiè xie nǐ la wǒ zài jiā lǐ děng nǐ nǐ dào le wǒ jiā yǐ hòu gěi wǒ fā yí ge duǎn xìn o",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lucy: Thank you so much! I will wait for you at home. When you get to my house, send me a text message!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好，一会儿见。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好，一會兒見。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo yí huì'r jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Okay, see you soon."
    }
  ],
